jmp-ai-music-player (1.2.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix the GNOME global media-key bindings.  They were written as "<F5>"
    instead of the GTK key name "F5".  In an accelerator string the angle
    brackets introduce a modifier, so GNOME ignored the shortcut and the keys
    still worked only while the JMP window had focus.
