    the next "Install global shortcuts" click (or jmp-media-keys --install):
    old entries are recognised by name and rewritten in place, not duplicated.
  * Old entries are reported as "window only" until repaired, so the Install
    button appears again instead of claiming a broken binding works.
  * No music file, tag or playlist is touched; a key press still runs exactly
    one transport command.

